  "content": "\n\n<h2>描述</h2>\n<p>Photon 是一款為 Minecraft 打造的視覺效果（VFX）編輯器模組，設計靈感源自 Unity。</p>\n<p>內含 Unity 風格的粒子系統與拖尾系統。不僅能協助模組開發者為內容添加特效，玩家也能透過指令直接體驗各種視覺效果。</p>\n<p>我們的初衷是讓熱愛 VFX 的玩家無需苦於技術門檻與數學公式。憑藉強大的創意工具，讓你輕鬆打造各種夢幻場景！！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Discord：<span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&redir_token=QUFFLUhqbkJVc1Y4b2Z0ak9LYlVBWWVFUEVmR3l6Q2E0Z3xBQ3Jtc0ttUFA5OEstbllEdEc3LXJ3bk4yOU1uTzdFd04wRThCYTVzYU9sRV9DWTI4aVZqMUJhNV9IZEg5SGNkbmMxeGJWbm9KSWhfdWVuLTBISlpEa0FqZUV3Z3Z5dUJNWFFIM0pVeVAwdlgyazR5dGxYRkRtdw&q=https://discord.com/invite/sDdf2yD9bh&v=rdB0qVXRgaY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discord.com/invite/sDdf2yD9bh</a></span></p>\n<p>GitHub：<span><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/redirect?event=video_description&redir_token=QUFFLUhqbEtLNFRscUFnVGxFVHFndXB2dTY4azE2ZC1Vd3xBQ3Jtc0tuRUFveDNEZmV3d0lfanFIcmxHcWttOUVZdnRZTVltUWFWTDJZTUs0THBCRzZoVjltUXF4SzJPQm9aclR3YTlTV3Vkd1YyVmF5QlJHVzBmSnhiX3ZsazFGTEppTUhGeGFlbkpLUFlBamVLZFVnTHA0UQ&q=https://github.com/Low-Drag-MC/Photon&v=rdB0qVXRgaY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/Low-Drag-MC/Photon</a></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/1fXFaWheYvc\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>圖片展示</h2>\n<h4 style=\"text-align:left\"><strong>Unity 風格粒子系統</strong></h4>\n<p><strong><span><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gzevkJbM/images/7de2e2d9457720fdd8b37ea465a55aa5366af998.png\" width=\"747\" height=\"435\"></span></strong></p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>拖尾特效</strong></h4>\n<p><strong><span><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gzevkJbM/images/18ef43b5b292df82cf807151cf5432505dc2daeb.png\" width=\"750\" height=\"431\"></span></strong></p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<h4><strong>自訂著色器材質</strong></h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gzevkJbM/images/aaf3fa1dfbf713235ef20a2a6fe6c7a1f5c4a0ab.png\" width=\"746\" height=\"430\"></strong></span></p>\n<h4>&nbsp;</h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>內建泛光特效（無需著色器模組）</strong></span></h4>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gzevkJbM/images/72ad816effd79b7add700f48f5d55625262c85a7.png\" width=\"751\" height=\"447\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>基於網格的粒子形狀</strong></h4>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gzevkJbM/images/69d93cdd3e19d3cf9dbb8c43be39c2826d502e28.png\" width=\"750\" height=\"418\"></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>物理系統</strong></h4>\n<p><span><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/gzevkJbM/images/a5c881645b98ca10358b9761451c63d70d51d1b2.png\" width=\"749\" height=\"404\"></span></p>\n<p><span>&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>支援著色器模組&nbsp;</strong></h4>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1116011072298680320/1117010580960722954/image.png\" width=\"748\" height=\"406\"></strong></p>",
